  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "code_clippy_github",
  "description": "The Code Clippy dataset consists of various public codebases from GitHub in 22 programming languages with 23 extensions     totalling about 16 TB of data when uncompressed. The dataset was created from the public GitHub dataset on Google BiqQuery.",
